resources.string:
Your data is never sold or rented, and is never used for advertising. Your name is never shown to employers. It is only sent to our processors, bound by contract and by confidentiality:
• Supabase (hosting, database, authentication, notifications), servers in the European Union;
• RevenueCat (subscription tracking), United States;
• Apple and Google (sign in, in app purchases, push notifications).

A share link only shows the card of the analysis you chose to share, never your name or email. You can delete a share at any time.
